+ * src	 |BIT(8)| BIT(7)| BIT(6)|
+ *-------------------------------
+ * txclk |   0	|  n/a	|   1	|
+ *-------------------------------
+ * ck_125|   0	|  n/a	|   0	|
+ *-------------------------------
+ * phyclk|   1	|   0	|  n/a	|
+ *-------------------------------
